Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:11.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:17.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:23.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:30.03,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:46.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:53.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.36,0:01:00.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.01,0:01:12.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:23.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:37.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落是我们的宿敌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:40.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借由搜集四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.87,0:01:42.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,力量变得越来越大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.87,0:01:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他不只跟犬夜叉有仇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管任何时候 他都不会自己动手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.14,0:01:51.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是卑劣的利用其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:54.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了解开 弥勒法师所中的风穴咒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:58.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了救出珊瑚的弟弟 被奈落囚禁的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要尽快的找到奈落 打败他才行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:08.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第80话 杀生丸和被掳的小玲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:50.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.01,0:02:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到那家伙的臭味了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:55.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风的味道变得不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:14.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:18.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲被人给掳走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.07,0:03:22.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚奈落的分身 神乐突然出现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:23.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把小玲给抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:30.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管放一百万个心吧 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:38.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你肯乖乖听我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:42.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证那个叫小玲的 一定会平安的回到你的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:44.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 又是你这个大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:46.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:49.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么？这次又想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:51.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实也没有特别想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:56.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你肯帮我干掉犬夜叉 那就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:06.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就为了这么点小事 需要这么大费周章吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:16.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这个是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:23.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:26.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会为了区区一个人类小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:28.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便乖乖地听命于你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.57,0:04:31.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道就这么放弃小玲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:43.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.37,0:05:05.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终究还是跟来了 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的 闻到了奈落的味道了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:18.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧 错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:19.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落这个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:21.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次让我抓到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.69,0:05:23.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非砍死他不可
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:26.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落一直神神秘秘 从没有现身过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:28.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么突然会出现
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:30.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:51.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被那个叫神乐的女人抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:53.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.93,0:05:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:02.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以 你不可以出去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要回去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下你明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:49.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一出去 马上会被他们撕成碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:51.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.21,0:06:54.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说 你也是被他们抓回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样我们一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是负责看住你的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:01.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:09.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你叫什么名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫小玲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.73,0:07:12.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你多大啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:14.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会在这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:16.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你是妖怪的同伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢吃什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:19.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西瓜喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:23.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个人话怎么这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:29.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:32.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都不说话好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 到底会不会来救我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.27,0:07:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.84,0:07:49.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底有什么打算嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问你到底有什么打算
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是奈落城
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:01.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:05.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里根本就不像是一座城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.07,0:08:21.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:32.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:48.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道奈落故意用臭味引诱我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.06,0:08:50.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我知道奈落城的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:53.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引我杀生丸进到里面去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.87,0:08:57.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不用一点小手段
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.17,0:09:00.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你会不会乖乖自投罗网呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:04.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.51,0:09:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要找的小姑娘 我不可能会把她藏在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座城堡到处都是瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.39,0:09:14.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看不需要一分钟 小姑娘就没气了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.89,0:09:19.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位小姑娘 我暂时把她安置在城外
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:21.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们可以不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:24.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你这个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:26.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是专程来救小玲的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.37,0:09:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点至少你应该明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:31.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:35.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀生丸少爷 一向都讨厌被人指挥的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.71,0:09:37.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是你所说的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:39.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你既不会去杀犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.21,0:09:41.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不会特地来救小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那显然是来杀我奈落了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.99,0:09:45.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点我也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:50.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千方百计把我引来 还在那里说风凉话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.49,0:09:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这笔帐待会再慢慢跟你算
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:57.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还得看你有没有命活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:04.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不喜欢也罢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.27,0:10:06.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就让我陪你玩一玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:15.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.55,0:10:16.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:18.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我们大家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底搞什么鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得四魂之玉碎片就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:29.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在对面那座山上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片就在那座山上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:37.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:39.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们负责追踪四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:40.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:43.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搜奈落城的工作就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:44.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.11,0:10:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就交给你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:47.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心一点 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.63,0:11:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:05.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的臭味突然之间消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.70,0:11:08.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道奈落城的结界又封闭了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不快点又要找不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.31,0:11:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是结界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:15.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:17.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤居然没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:41.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次你休想跑掉 大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:53.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:55.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一路上真是辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:12:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就让我奈落 好好的陪你玩个够
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:08.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:17.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是一些没用的死妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:19.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:21.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道这就是你的原形吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:22.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的原形
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 这是小意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.15,0:12:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才正要开始玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.73,0:12:42.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的想要我杀生丸这条命是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:51.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.71,0:12:52.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:54.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对奈落到底有什么好处
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.41,0:12:59.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧 难道奈落这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.25,0:13:08.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片就在这附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.92,0:13:10.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于被你感应到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:12.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 应该就在奈落城旁边了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:15.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:18.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想碎片应该是一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.43,0:13:21.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:23.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是珊瑚的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:27.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀身体里面刚好有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:38.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道真的是琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西瓜真的好甜喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:48.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还要不要再吃一片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:55.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.97,0:13:57.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我随时都可以再去偷一点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:03.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀你真的什么都不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.15,0:14:10.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连自己的爸妈也不记得
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:12.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我全忘光了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:18.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道连自己的父母都会忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:20.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是完全没印象
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:24.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候 我会想起一些可怕的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事是你自己不愿意去回想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:30.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:31.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸妈妈还有我哥哥他们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.21,0:14:38.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全家人都被强盗杀死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:41.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到现在还常常梦到他们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.85,0:14:43.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得好难过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:46.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很吵对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.95,0:14:49.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都没出声 是不是觉得我很烦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:51.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:55.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经好久 没有跟人说这么多话了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:10.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别出声
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:21.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:25.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个人的样子我一直都记得
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:29.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来都没有忘掉过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.15,0:15:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:48.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子已经完全不记得自己做过些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:51.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经彻底毁在我的手里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.99,0:15:53.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从今以后他什么都不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他死其实对他是一种解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:04.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你在里面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.43,0:16:05.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.14,0:16:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:46.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个下等的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:49.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒要看看你有什么能耐碰我杀生丸一根指头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒要仔细瞧瞧\N你这样的滥招数能玩到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:25.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掉下来的这一片片肉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.05,0:17:28.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都会变成我身上的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:30.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:34.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落正在吸收杀生丸的肉体
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.39,0:17:37.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它变成自己身体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.35,0:17:59.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.08,0:18:01.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:02.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会突然在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:05.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然在这里消失了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:11.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说这里是奈落城
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股毒气跟瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:19.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:22.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是奈落的结界了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:24.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.35,0:18:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了 终于看到奈落城了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:50.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.97,0:18:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底什么人 在城外破坏我的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:18:56.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 马上去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.47,0:19:01.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有贵客到了 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.14,0:19:03.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个客人也真倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:06.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大老远专程来拜访你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:10.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果 他恐怕没机会见到你活着了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:11.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.93,0:19:26.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就大功告成了 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:28.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻就会被我这块肉消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:31.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候 你会变成我身体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:34.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.75,0:19:43.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙的刀锋变成红色了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:45.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:47.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你破坏结界的是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.99,0:19:51.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还需要问吗 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.16,0:19:54.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子 你已经不够资格跟我较量了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:19:57.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我劝你快点滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:59.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站在那里 小心被我给砍死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.34,0:20:07.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:10.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你千万别跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:12.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天要让你尝尝我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.98,0:20:17.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我跟你 得好好打一场才行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐之风一点杀气都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.43,0:20:30.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想不想打
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎被他看穿我毫无斗志了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来只好先在这挡一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.33,0:20:58.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就交给他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:04.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是一些笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.30,0:21:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:13.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:37.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸那小子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我太高估他了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:42.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.27,0:21:45.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:50.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.84,0:21:52.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开 你们这帮妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以现在的犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该可以打败奈落才对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.89,0:22:00.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要真是这样 我就可以重获自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.57,0:22:20.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.08,0:22:27.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.05,0:22:34.05,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.73,0:22:40.79,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.10,0:22:47.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.81,0:22:54.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.11,0:23:01.21,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.82,0:23:07.95,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.39,0:23:14.82,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.13,0:23:21.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.91,0:23:28.11,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.78,0:23:34.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.39,0:23:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次是我失算
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.76,0:23:50.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到犬夜叉会采取这样的攻势
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.93,0:23:51.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 等着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.27,0:23:53.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我非打败你不可
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.03,0:23:54.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想得美
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.17,0:23:58.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我奈落已经完全得到杀生丸身上的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.11,0:24:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为那么容易可以打败我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.71,0:24:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说…杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.98,0:24:03.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚你有多少能耐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.18,0:24:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你同样要成为我肉体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.95,0:24:09.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回的犬夜叉是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.48,0:24:11.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落大坏蛋下落不明
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.42,0:24:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 马上给我杀了小玲
